# Spec editing rules

- Keep acceptance criteria **verifiable** (name the command/test/assertion).
- Prefer rewriting prose after interrogation answers over appending Q&A dumps.
- Mark status clearly: `DRAFT` → `READY_FOR_APPROVAL` → `APPROVED`.
- Link the ticket id in the spec header when one exists.
- Do not delete premortem risks — convert them into mitigations or explicit out-of-scope.
